window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>I escaped my Monster Mates. Now I'm the Demon God's captive.</b></p> <p>I've been taken by Malek, the Demon God. He pulls me into a new world of dark desire and passion. We strike a deal. If Malek fails to claim my heart, he must abandon his war plans. But if he should prevail, the world as we know it will change forever.</p> <p>It should be easy to resist his charms, but this powerful demon king was built for seduction. Irresistible from horns to toes, his supernatural powers of persuasion are utterly hypnotizing. Our hidden past draws us closer together, but is Malek hiding something?</p> <p>My demi-god mates come for me, determined to win me back. But Malek refuses to let them get in his way. To Malek, my mates are a nuisance and must be dealt with as such. The epic battle for my heart is reaching an explosive climax and none of these Hot, Powerful Alphas will ever let me go.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
